each one keeps, and where its notice lives. It is a map, not a replacement for the
licenses themselves: the binding text is the license file next to each component.

Verified against the manifests on 2026-11-10 (`assets/fonts/fonts.json`,
`tools/font-packages.lock.json`, `tools/toolkit/package-lock.json`,
`medo-motion/templates/remotion/package-lock.json`, `tools/requirements*.txt`).

