## 4. Trademarks

All product names, logos and brands referenced by the studio (including those in the
icon library) are the property of their respective owners and are used descriptively.
They are not licensed by this repository and must not be used as the identity of a
derived product. The studio deliberately has no on-screen logo of its own.

## 5. Reporting a licensing problem

If you believe a component is attributed incorrectly or a notice is missing, open an
issue with the file path and the upstream source. Provenance is recorded per asset in
[`assets/CREDITS.md`](assets/CREDITS.md); that file is the first place to correct.
